msgid "Declined by your shop on sudemi; the buyer was not charged. The stock has been restored."
msgstr "已由你的店铺在 sudemi 上拒绝；买家未被扣款。库存已恢复。"

msgid "Declined automatically by sudemi (for example because the order was not answered in time); the buyer was not charged. The stock has been restored."
msgstr "已由 sudemi 自动拒绝（例如因为订单未在规定时间内得到答复）；买家未被扣款。库存已恢复。"

msgid "Cancelled by the buyer on sudemi before the order was confirmed; the buyer was not charged. The stock has been restored."
msgstr "买家在订单确认前已于 sudemi 上取消；买家未被扣款。库存已恢复。"

#, php-format
msgid "sudemi order %1$s was declined by your shop on sudemi; order #%2$s was cancelled here and the stock restored."
msgstr "sudemi 订单 %1$s 已由你的店铺在 sudemi 上拒绝；订单 #%2$s 已在此取消，库存已恢复。"

#, php-format
msgid "sudemi order %1$s was declined automatically by sudemi; order #%2$s was cancelled here and the stock restored."
msgstr "sudemi 订单 %1$s 已由 sudemi 自动拒绝；订单 #%2$s 已在此取消，库存已恢复。"

#, php-format
msgid "sudemi order %1$s was cancelled by the buyer before it was confirmed; order #%2$s was cancelled here and the stock restored."
msgstr "sudemi 订单 %1$s 已由买家在确认前取消；订单 #%2$s 已在此取消，库存已恢复。"

#, php-format
msgid "sudemi order %1$s was declined on sudemi; order #%2$s was cancelled here and the stock restored."
msgstr "sudemi 订单 %1$s 已在 sudemi 上被拒绝；订单 #%2$s 已在此取消，库存已恢复。"

#, php-format
msgid "Reason: %s."
msgstr "原因：%s。"

#, php-format
msgid "sudemi order %1$s could not be applied here yet (%2$s); it is read from sudemi again on the next heartbeats."
msgstr "sudemi 订单 %1$s 暂时无法在此应用（%2$s）；将在接下来的心跳中重新从 sudemi 读取。"

#, php-format
msgid "sudemi order %1$s is not applied here: sudemi no longer has it for this shop (%2$s). Check the WooCommerce order by hand."
msgstr "sudemi 订单 %1$s 不会在此应用：sudemi 上已不再有此店铺的该订单（%2$s）。请手动检查 WooCommerce 订单。"

#, php-format
msgid "Gave up applying sudemi order %1$s here after %2$d tries (%3$s). Check this order under WooCommerce > sudemi > Orders and update the WooCommerce order by hand."
msgstr "尝试 %2$d 次后已放弃在此应用 sudemi 订单 %1$s（%3$s）。请在 WooCommerce > sudemi > 订单 中查看此订单，并手动更新 WooCommerce 订单。"
